   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_28"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'm alright, a bit tired.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.66,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_05"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "This is my first international flight and I'm honestly a bit anxious. When should I get to the airport?",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 0.59,
   "block": "travel_planning.dlg6",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "For international flights, about three hours before departure is a safe rule.",
   "est_sec": 3.82,
   "gap_before": 0.89,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "travel_planning.dlg6"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Oh, also, we're moving to a house near a quiet road, and our cat has only ever lived in a flat.",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 1.2,
   "block": "pets.ctx9",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Big change for her. Are you thinking of keeping her indoors, or letting her start going outside?",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 0.76,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "pets.ctx9"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Okay, so for the second part— sorry, my son's got a problem. Bear with me.",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 1.0,
   "event": "instruction",
   "kind": "side_conversation",
   "phrasing": "side_instruction_v2_40"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Okay, no rush.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.63,
   "role": "ack",
   "phrasing": "ack_10"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Sam, why is my bookmark in the middle of your book?",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 0.94,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "friend_question",
   "block": "books.side4"
  },
  {
